# S.S. Botany Bay: the exile links to the ability's source, and "Whenever S.S. Botany Bay deals combat damage to a
# player, return each creature card you own exiled with it to the battlefield." A Bear Cub (Bot1's) and a Grizzly Bears
# (Bot2's) die in combat, and Botany Bay's next {T} exiles one from each graveyard with the link; Bot1 stations a
# Gigantosaurus (power 10) to reach the 8+ striation in one activation and attacks the turn it got the counter: Bot2
# goes from 20 to 17 and Bot1's Bear Cub comes back, while Bot2's Grizzly Bears - not owned by Bot1 - stays exiled
# (CR 607.2a, 510.2, 702.184a, 721.2a-b, 108.3).

